            "notes": "This is a late-game focused build, so for round 1, you want to stay alive and farm credits.  If you try to get kills, you will likely be traded out or get no kills since your firepower isn't very high right now.\n\n[Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69) and [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) is for a more agressive first round\n\n[Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) and [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7) is for a more passive/safe first round\n\nLosing the first round is very likely, so don't get discouraged if you die a lot this round",
