            "notes": "[Overcharged Ordnance](item_f261877b-39e5-4248-aeca-7fe34de8ce10) is a must-have and should NEVER be sold even on round 7 since it's that important.\n\nI personally like [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) because it gives more dmg and helps survive longer.\n\nIf you have extra money, go for [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) for more dmg or [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7) for more ability lifesteal (survivability) when using mini barrages.\n\nDon't be discouraged if you lose rounds 1 and 2, since you are much more effective later",
