            "created_at": "2025-09-06T19:47:11.676597+00:00",
            "notes": "[Recursion Battery](item_88c3fb1a-2d38-4d2c-b439-6aadd038fd1a) is SUPER important if you don't want to die in the later rounds when you can get kills.\nI like pairing it up with [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) because the 25% lifesteal can give 100 extra overhealth on max hp, which I feel is more beneficial than [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) if you have a mercy pocket.\n\nFor the rest of the items, build ability power and ability lifesteal to increase the effectiveness of your mini barrages.\n\nThis is the round where you should start getting kills and winning, since you can now survive with your mini barrages long enough to delete the enemy team one at a time (you still have to play behind cover/walls to not instadie to hitscan)",
